          "distinct": false,
          "id": "b886e80a05f8f05ec6a7fe4d6365aed13221b2d9",
          "message": "bench(jsonld): W3C JSON-LD 1.1 self-conformance scoreboard runner (sq-w42s3) [FABLE-5] (#2039)\n\n* bench(jsonld): W3C JSON-LD 1.1 self-conformance scoreboard runner (sq-w42s3) [FABLE-5]\n\nAdds crates/sparq-jsonld/examples/jsonld_conformance.rs — a dependency-free\nper-operation pass-rate scoreboard over the pinned W3C json-ld-api +\njson-ld-framing suites through the crate's NATIVE expand/compact/flatten/\nframe/fromRdf entries, with an explicit implemented:false toRdf gap row\n(native §8.2 is sq-oy1f.30). Emits a human table + complete failing-test\nlisting + machine-readable JSON (--json); full runs assert ratchet floors\n(>=), --smoke asserts exact pinned counts (the bead's acceptance gate);\nabsent suites SKIP + exit 0 (offline-green). Hermetic comparator /\nN-Quads-reader unit tests run via the [[example]] test=true target.\n\nresearch/gap-jsonld-conformance-2026-07.md records the measured row (expand\n71.6 strict / compact 92.6 / flatten 91.3 / frame 100.0 / fromRdf 98.1),\nreconciles the stale sq-hmd7l.22 cells (floors rose since), preserves the\nhonest BEHIND verdicts, and files sq-uzdw7 for the single outright fail.\n\nBead: sq-w42s3 (epic sq-hmd7l)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(research): add language to bare code fence (MD040) [FABLE-5]\n\nFixes the docs-quality quick-gates markdownlint failure on PR #2039\n(research/gap-jsonld-conformance-2026-07.md:21 MD040/fenced-code-language).\nThe vectorized-feature-off quick-gates failure was a transient GitHub\npaths-filter server error; legs 1/self-test/3 reproduced GREEN locally.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
